        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Scuba N1 Plus is a dependable, straightforward clean for in-ground pools up to 1,600 sq ft. No mapping to configure, no AI patrol to babysit, just real coverage of the floor, walls, and waterline.<br/><br/>🔋 A brushless drain motor filters up to 4,800 GPH.<br/>🐛 Caterpillar treads hold onto walls, not just the floor.<br/>🌊 WavePath™ navigation follows your pool's natural flow instead of a fixed route.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Reliable Pool Care, Without the Learning Curve. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p>Built for in-ground pools up to 1,600 sq ft (150m²), 50 ft in length, the Scuba N1 Plus keeps things simple: floor, walls, and waterline, handled without an AI patrol or a mapping routine to set up.</p><h3>Real suction, no gimmicks</h3><p>A brushless drain motor filters up to 4,800 GPH while a dynamic silicone brush lifts dirt and debris. Caterpillar treads give it the traction to hold onto walls, not just cruise the floor.</p><h3>Follows the water, not a script</h3><p>WavePath™ navigation reads your pool's natural flow to increase cleaning coverage, adapting instead of repeating the same lap every time.</p><h3>Four ways to clean</h3><p>Choose Floor, Wall, Auto (floor + wall + waterline), or Eco mode, which runs a 45-minute cycle every 48 hours so your pool stays swim-ready without you thinking about it.</p><h3>Ownership, handled</h3><ul><li><strong>Dual filtration</strong> – swap between a 180μm fine filter basket or a 3μm MicroMesh™ ultra-fine filter, 3.5L top-load capacity.</li><li><strong>OTA updates</strong> through the Aiper App keep it current automatically.</li><li><strong>2-year manufacturer's warranty.</strong></li><li><strong>Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros,</strong> before and after the sale.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Aiper's 2-year manufacturer's warranty on the cleaner (6 months on the DC charger and retrieval hook). We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>No installation, no boundary mapping. Charge it with the included DC charger, drop it in the pool, and choose Floor, Wall, Auto, or Eco mode from the device or the Aiper App. Use the included retrieval hook to lift it out when it's done.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Cleaning &amp; Power</h3><ul><li><strong>Suction:</strong> Up to 4,800 GPH, brushless drain motor</li><li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Floor, walls, and waterline</li><li><strong>Pool size:</strong> Up to 1,600 sq ft (150m²), in-ground, 50 ft in length</li></ul><h3>Navigation &amp; Modes</h3><ul><li><strong>WavePath™ navigation:</strong> Adapts to your pool's natural water flow</li><li><strong>Modes:</strong> Floor, Wall, Auto (Floor + Wall + Waterline), Eco (45-min cycle every 48 hrs, x3)</li></ul><h3>Filtration</h3><ul><li><strong>Dual filtration:</strong> 180μm fine filter basket or 3μm MicroMesh™ ultra-fine filter</li><li><strong>Basket capacity:</strong> 3.5L, top-load</li></ul><h3>Battery &amp; Build</h3><ul><li><strong>Battery:</strong> Up to 180 minutes runtime</li><li><strong>Charge time:</strong> 3–4 hours, DC charger</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 7.9kg / 17.4 lbs</li></ul><h3>Smart Features &amp; Warranty</h3><ul><li><strong>OTA updates</strong> via the Aiper App</li><li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 2-year manufacturer's warranty (6 months on DC charger and retrieval hook)</li></ul>"
          }
        },
